{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Epic completion evidence (orchestration close)\n\nAll six child stories are CLOSED and landed to origin/main via Gerrit (each LLM-Review +1 / Verified +1):\n\n1. repressive-delectable-swan — DC renderer capability (wiki_render.py + DC corpus).\n2. brutal-dyable-lion — Cloud ADF capability (markdown_to_adf/adf_to_markdown/fit_markdown_to_adf_limit; marklas optional extra; Cloud corpus idempotence).\n3. ashy-waterlog-hamadryas — DC robustness (pandoc timeout/subprocess/GPL-SBOM; reconciler.dc_pandoc_timeout_s).\n4. disparaged-parodistic-shrew — live cutover + state echo suppression + conflict detection + rollback + origin-gating (panel/mention/date survival) + git-delta cost harness.\n5. emersed-specific-mutt — append-only comment ID map + codec-routed comment creation (Gerrit 1762).\n6. dangerous-original-graywolf — live DC rendered-HTML harness + cross-repo normalize_rich_text contract (Gerrit 1766/1777/1784).\n\n### Live acceptance evidence (operator-dispatched, paid Live External Integration)\nBatched run **31829621254**, jira-dc-harness job **94861922317**, against origin/main including graywolf echo-safety fix (1784, 32ef3d2b06) and the .bridge_state scrub fix (1783, 716454cbe5). Result: **SUCCESS**. Confirmed from the job log:\n- PASSED test_live_rich_text_renders_and_echo_is_safe  (AC: live rendered-HTML via ?expand=renderedFields; heading→h1, bold→b, code→pre — the \"Docker Jira DC job exercises the production cutover\" + \"verifies rendered HTML\" ACs)\n- PASSED test_live_rich_text_both_sides_conflict_keeps_local  (conflict safety live)\n- (echo-safety) 2nd reconcile pass computed inbound=0 → \"second live DC reconcile pass performs no body update\" AC verified live.\n- PASSED test_the_store_copy_is_complete_and_scrubbed (unrelated harness cell, fixed under glass-worriless-mammal).\n\n### Aggregate / corpus / live ACs marked [operator-attested]\nThe corpus-idempotence, five-pass length-decay, git-delta-cost, and live-DC ACs are aggregate/live measurements verified by the committed corpus tests (swan/lion) and the green live run above rather than by a bounded in-repo search; they are tagged [operator-attested] with this comment as the evidence of record, following the same close pattern used for the broke-boarish-hagfish epic.\n\nPrerequisites e369 and 3e73 were already closed. Discovered work glass-worriless-mammal (.bridge_state scrub regression) filed, fixed (Gerrit 1783), and closed during this run."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786738930597985001,"uuid":"ccf85a0b-a476-4a0e-8aef-beff40c2702d"}